{"id":"611186","name":"奶香玉米面馒头","author":"红•宏","authorId":"10737312","desc":"","cover":"images/611186/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"普通面粉","amount":"250g"},{"name":"玉米面粉","amount":"250g"}],"sub":[{"name":"发酵粉","amount":"5g"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"250ml"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备玉米面和普通面粉各一半。","img":"images/611186/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"里面加发酵粉和白糖。","img":"images/611186/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将面粉和发酵粉搅拌均匀，用牛奶和面。","img":"images/611186/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"揉成光滑的面团。","img":"images/611186/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"醒发好的面团。","img":"images/611186/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搓成长条。","img":"images/611186/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"切成小段。","img":"images/611186/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"做成馒头形状二次醒发至两倍大。","img":"images/611186/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"冷水上锅蒸20分钟，焖5分钟。","img":"images/611186/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"奶香浓郁，香甜可口的玉米面馒头就可以开吃啦。","img":"images/611186/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"我基本没用清水，用牛奶和面味道更加浓郁。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}